        "id": 252954,
        "name": "doppelgangerung",
        "username": "doppelgangerung",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/doppelgangerung/{size}/1876_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-06-25T12:18:47.487Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This was a slugfest and a half!</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/8/880b4a4d26e82ac5a610d9068dd12f879a4cafe8.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/880b4a4d26e82ac5a610d9068dd12f879a4cafe8\" title=\"Screenshot_20230619-235524\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/880b4a4d26e82ac5a610d9068dd12f879a4cafe8_2_219x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20230619-235524\" data-base62-sha1=\"jpv7LiBWE6p7h77TRVKodQlkZXW\" width=\"219\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/880b4a4d26e82ac5a610d9068dd12f879a4cafe8_2_219x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/880b4a4d26e82ac5a610d9068dd12f879a4cafe8_2_328x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/880b4a4d26e82ac5a610d9068dd12f879a4cafe8_2_438x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/880b4a4d26e82ac5a610d9068dd12f879a4cafe8_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20230619-235524</span><span class=\"informations\">1080×2460 231 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Cursed Acolyte, Drum Of Despair and Grimoire Of Curses (not to mention Gloomy himself) took a toll on the heroes, but behind every Setback there’s a Silver Lining (or two) and every hero that went down caused Pete to shine brighter! Dual High Risk Behaviors, frequent use of Looking Up, and a Cause And Effect that finished off Gloomweaver, sparing Setback his portion of the effect - this was definitely his show!</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
