        "raw": "This was a slugfest and a half!\n\n![Screenshot_20230619-235524|219x500](upload://jpv7LiBWE6p7h77TRVKodQlkZXW.jpeg)\n\nCursed Acolyte, Drum Of Despair and Grimoire Of Curses (not to mention Gloomy himself) took a toll on the heroes, but behind every Setback there's a Silver Lining (or two) and every hero that went down caused Pete to shine brighter! Dual High Risk Behaviors, frequent use of Looking Up, and a Cause And Effect that finished off Gloomweaver, sparing Setback his portion of the effect - this was definitely his show!",
